"1v1dkl2": "<div class=\"small muted\">Calculated from nine blood test values using the Phenotypic Age formula (Levine 2018). Healthy people often get a biological age a few years below their actual age.</div></div></div>",
"293ri4": "You indicated cancer, chronic lung disease or another serious illness. These are not included in the number: their effect depends heavily on the type, stage and treatment, and the model is built on the general population. So the estimate here is probably too optimistic for you, and your treating doctor is the right person to ask.",
