"1w5qym9": "Research-based guides on sleep, nutrition, fasting, sugar, movement and relationships, and a calculator that shows what affects your life expectancy and what you can change.",
"1wlkcio": "Calculate my life expectancy",
"wok938": "To the guides",
"i5hgle": "No sign-up, your data stays on your device",
"j7bpr9": "Every number with a research source",
"nu7cbx": "Five habits, more than a decade of life",
"3dct7f": "In a Harvard study that followed more than 120,000 people for up to 34 years, women at age 50 who adopted all five habits were projected to live 14 years longer than those who adopted none. For men: 12.2 years.",
"wlpk8x": "Source:",
"5h3gn0": "The guides",
"9qdzv2": "What affects how long we live, and what to do about it",
"1h30rej": "Each guide: what the research found, practical steps you can tick off, common myths, and sources.",
"146ixfx": "The main tool",
"ksj60l": "A personal life expectancy calculator",
"15148uc": "It starts from the World Health Organization life table for your age, sex and country, and adjusts it for dozens of factors from large studies. The result is a range, not a date, with a breakdown of what adds and what takes away years.",
