"70s5p5": "Your numbers",
"g1a2w1": "Blood pressure, blood sugar and waist size: what to check and what the ranges are.",
"1sc3e3l": "Most of the factors that shorten life are silent at first. High blood pressure or high blood sugar don't hurt, so the only way to know is to measure. These are the numbers worth knowing, and the calculator can read them from a blood test file too.",
"96k8xy": "mmHg",
"1lzzzw3": "Normal blood pressure according to the American guideline (2017)",
"14jqaqx": "Normal fasting glucose. 100–125 is prediabetes",
"12lwzku": "Normal. 5.7%–6.4% is prediabetes",
"iy7mcr": "According to the ACC and AHA guideline (2017): normal is below 120/80, elevated is 120–129 systolic, and hypertension is 130/80 and above. Home measurements on several different days are more accurate than a single reading at the clinic.",
"4ldvgb": "According to the American Diabetes Association: fasting glucose of 100–125 mg/dL or HbA1c of 5.7%–6.4% is prediabetes, and 126 or more or 6.5% or more is diabetes (confirmed by a repeat test).",
