"1gwkro0": "Less salt",
"1296xvg": "Under 5 grams a day, about a teaspoon. Limit salty snacks and high-sodium seasonings and sauces, and cook with less salt.",
"cx9635": "A Mediterranean direction",
"g8m1sa": "Vegetables, fruit, legumes, whole grains, nuts, fish and olive oil as the base. In meta-analyses, a two-point increase in the Mediterranean diet adherence score was linked to about 8%–9% lower mortality. The definition of a \"Mediterranean diet\" varies between studies, and this is an observational association.",
"his9y": "Sofi 2008: the Mediterranean diet (BMJ)",
