"1udrfg9": "A few minutes of grounding a day",
"1d3a4zw": "Stop, feel the soles of your feet on the floor, breathe slowly and notice a few things you can see and hear around you. This is a sample exercise of the kind in the World Health Organization guide, which contains more exercises.",
"190k80": "One small action a day based on what matters to you",
"1vk9rr3": "One of the skills in the World Health Organization guide: choose one practical thing a day that fits what matters to you, even on a hard day. A few minutes a day are enough.",
